[msg ModMenu_About[Mod Menu]]
[s]Adds debugging tools for fields, events,
[n]flags, party data, Social Links, and more.[e]

[msg QuickTravelPlus_About[Quick Travel Plus]]
[s]Adds more fast travel destinations while
[n]respecting time and story restrictions.[e]

[msg MobileCalendar_About[Mobile Calendar]]
[s]View the calendar directly from
[n]the Expanded Sub Menu.[e]

[msg DungeonOptions_About[Dungeon Options]]
[s]Configure Tartarus quality of life
[n]and debugging features.[e]

[msg FindAFriend_About[Find A Friend]]
[s]Shows available Social Links and lets
[n]you travel to their normal location.[e]

[msg SaveAnywhere_About[Save Anywhere]]
[s]Save from the Expanded Sub Menu
[n]outside normal save points.[e]

[msg SaveEveryday_About[Save Everyday]]
[s]Prompts for a save at a safe point
[n]after the day changes.[e]

[msg RemoveFillerEvents_About[Remove Filler Events]]
[s]Skips selected required events that
[n]do not affect story progression.[e]

[msg RemoveLunchtimeInvites_About[Remove Lunchtime Invitations]]
[s]Skips hallway invitations when a
[n]Social Link is ready to rank up.[e]

[msg GBHE_About[Go Back Home Easily]]
[s]Returning to the dorm on days off
[n]will not advance time.[e]

