[msg ShowTheClock_About[Healing Clock Anywhere]]
[s]Adds the healing clock to the Sub Menu
[n]while exploring Tartarus.[e]

[msg AutoHealing_About[Auto Heal]]
[s]Automatically heals after climbing.
[n]Q Menu recovery stays free.[e]

[msg OrganizeParty_About[Organize Party Anywhere]]
[s]Change the party from Tartarus floors
[n]without returning to the entrance.[e]

[msg FloorSelect_About[Select Reached Tartarus Floor]]
[s]Travel to Tartarus floors that
[n]have already been reached.[e]

[msg TraestoGems_About[Use Traesto Gems]]
[s]Use a Traesto Gem directly from
[n]the Tartarus Sub Menu.[e]

[msg DefaultDirectCommands_About[Default Direct Commands]]
[s]Sets controllable party members to
[n]Direct Commands by default.[e]

[msg GameOverSkip_About[Skip Game Over]]
[s]Skips the Velvet Room game over
[n]scene before retrying.[e]

[msg TartarusWarp_About[Tartarus Warp]]
[s]Adds Entrance and Next Floor warp options.
[n]Next Floor only appears after the stairs are found.[e]

[msg RareChestWarning_About[Rare Chest Warning]]
[s]Warns once when the current Tartarus floor
[n]contains a rare chest.[e]

